#. ja: 何をする？
#. de: Wähle eine Option.
#. fr: Que voulez-vous faire<nbsp>?
msgctxt "custom/005/CtsErkEureka3AdjustTool_00539:TEXT_CTSERKEUREKA3ADJUSTTOOL_00539_Q1_000_000:1"
msgid "What would you like to do?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: サブパラメータの付与
#. de: Sub-Parameter implantieren
#. fr: Greffer des bonus additionnels
msgctxt "custom/005/CtsErkEureka3AdjustTool_00539:TEXT_CTSERKEUREKA3ADJUSTTOOL_00539_A1_000_001:1"
msgid "Enhance Eureka weapon with mnemes."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 説明書を読む
#. de: Anleitung lesen
#. fr: Lire le manuel d'utilisation
msgctxt "custom/005/CtsErkEureka3AdjustTool_00539:TEXT_CTSERKEUREKA3ADJUSTTOOL_00539_A1_000_002:1"
msgid "Read the manual."
msgstr ""

#. ja: キャンセル
#. de: Abbrechen
#. fr: Annuler
msgctxt "custom/005/CtsErkEureka3AdjustTool_00539:TEXT_CTSERKEUREKA3ADJUSTTOOL_00539_A1_000_003:1"
msgid "Nothing."
msgstr ""

#. ja: サブパラメータを付与できる武器を持っていなかった……。
#. de: Du hast keine Waffe, in die Sub-Parameter implantiert werden können.
#. fr: Vous ne possédez aucune arme pouvant recevoir une greffe de bonus additionnels.
msgctxt "custom/005/CtsErkEureka3AdjustTool_00539:TEXT_CTSERKEUREKA3ADJUSTTOOL_00539_SYSTEM_000_000:1"
msgid "You do not possess a Eureka weapon which can be enhanced with mnemes."
msgstr ""

#. ja: どの武器にサブパラメータを付与する？
#. de: Auf welche Waffe möchtest du einen Sub-Parameter implantieren?
#. fr: Sur quelle arme ou bouclier souhaitez-vous greffer de nouveaux bonus additionnels<nbsp>?
msgctxt "custom/005/CtsErkEureka3AdjustTool_00539:TEXT_CTSERKEUREKA3ADJUSTTOOL_00539_Q1_001_000:1"
msgid "Select a Eureka weapon."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <sheet Item $n1 0>に付与する
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de Item 5 $n1 1 1 1></capitalize>
#. fr: <sheet Item $n1 9>
#. macro: <sheet Item $n1 9> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = Item, row = number parameter 1, column = 9 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/005/CtsErkEureka3AdjustTool_00539:TEXT_CTSERKEUREKA3ADJUSTTOOL_00539_A1_001_001:1"
msgid "<sheet Item $n1 9>."
msgstr ""

#. ja: やめる
#. de: Abbrechen
#. fr: Annuler
msgctxt "custom/005/CtsErkEureka3AdjustTool_00539:TEXT_CTSERKEUREKA3ADJUSTTOOL_00539_A1_001_002:1"
msgid "Cancel."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「<sheet Item 24122 0>」が足りず、<br>「<sheet Item $n1 0>」に、<br>サブパラメータを付与できなかった……。
#. de: Du verfügst nicht über ausreichend <noun-de Item 5 24122 2 4 1>, daher konnte der Sub-Parameter nicht in <noun-de Item 3 $n1 1 4 1> implantiert werden.
#. fr: Vous ne disposez pas des composants nécessaires pour greffer des bonus additionnels sur votre <noun-fr Item 12 $n1 1 1>.
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 24122 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = 24122, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/005/CtsErkEureka3AdjustTool_00539:TEXT_CTSERKEUREKA3ADJUSTTOOL_00539_SYSTEM_000_010:1"
msgid "You do not have the required <noun-en Item 3 24122 2 1> to enhance <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> with mnemes."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「<sheet Item $n1 0>」に、<br>記憶を転写し、サブパラメータを付与するには、<br>「<sheet Item 24122 0>」が、あと「<num $n2>」個、必要です。
#. de: Um die Mneme zu extrahieren und als Sub-Parameter in <noun-de Item 2 $n1 1 4 1> zu implantieren, benötigst du noch <noun-de Item 1 24122 $n2 4 1>.
#. fr: Récupérez encore <num $n2> <noun-fr Item 12 24122 "<if ($n2 == 1)>{1}<else>{2}</if>" 1> pour pouvoir procéder à une greffe.
#. macro: <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if $n2><if ($n2 <= 10)><switch $n2><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n2><… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($n2 <= 10)><switch $n2><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n2></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 2 <= 10 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $n2><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 24122 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = 24122, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/005/CtsErkEureka3AdjustTool_00539:TEXT_CTSERKEUREKA3ADJUSTTOOL_00539_SYSTEM_000_011:1"
msgid "In order to enhance <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> with mnemes, <if $n2><if ($n2 <= 10)><switch $n2><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n2></if><else><num $n2></if> <noun-en Item 3 24122 2 1> are required."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「<sheet Item 24122 0>」を「<num $n2>」個消費して、<br>「<sheet Item $n1 0>」にサブパラメータを、<br>付与するための記憶を抽出しますか？
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de Item 1 24122 $n2 4 1></capitalize> verbrauchen und die extrahierte Mneme in <noun-de Item 2 $n1 1 4 1> als Sub-Parameter implantieren?
#. fr: Utiliser <num $n2> <noun-fr Item 12 24122 "<if ($n2 == 1)>{1}<else>{2}</if>" 1> et extraire des souvenirs pour greffer des bonus additionnels sur votre <noun-fr Item 12 $n1 1 1><nbsp>?
#. macro: <if $n2><if ($n2 <= 10)><switch $n2><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n2><… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($n2 <= 10)><switch $n2><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n2></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 2 <= 10 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $n2><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 24122 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = 24122, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/005/CtsErkEureka3AdjustTool_00539:TEXT_CTSERKEUREKA3ADJUSTTOOL_00539_YESNO_000:1"
msgid "Extract and transubstantiate mnemes from <if $n2><if ($n2 <= 10)><switch $n2><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n2></if><else><num $n2></if> <noun-en Item 3 24122 2 1> in order to enhance <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1>?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「<sheet Item 24122 0>」を「<num $n2>」個消費し、<br>再度、「<sheet Item $n1 0>」にサブパラメータを、<br>付与するための記憶を抽出しますか？
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de Item 1 24122 $n2 4 1></capitalize> verbrauchen und erneut die extrahierte Mneme in <noun-de Item 2 $n1 1 4 1> als Sub-Parameter implantieren?
#. fr: Utiliser encore <num $n2> <noun-fr Item 12 24122 "<if ($n2 == 1)>{1}<else>{2}</if>" 1> et retenter d'extraire des souvenirs pour greffer des bonus additionnels sur votre <noun-fr Item 12 $n1 1 1><nbsp>?
#. macro: <if $n2><if ($n2 <= 10)><switch $n2><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n2><… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($n2 <= 10)><switch $n2><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n2></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 2 <= 10 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $n2><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 24122 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = 24122, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/005/CtsErkEureka3AdjustTool_00539:TEXT_CTSERKEUREKA3ADJUSTTOOL_00539_YESNO_001:1"
msgid "Once again extract and transubstantiate mnemes from <if $n2><if ($n2 <= 10)><switch $n2><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n2></if><else><num $n2></if> <noun-en Item 3 24122 2 1> in order to enhance <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1>?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: どの項目を読む？
#. de: Wähle eine Kategorie.
#. fr: Quel chapitre souhaitez-vous lire<nbsp>?
msgctxt "custom/005/CtsErkEureka3AdjustTool_00539:TEXT_CTSERKEUREKA3ADJUSTTOOL_00539_Q2_000_000:1"
msgid "Select a topic."
msgstr ""

#. ja: サブパラメータの付与について
#. de: Erklärung zu den Sub-Parametern
#. fr: La greffe de bonus additionnels
msgctxt "custom/005/CtsErkEureka3AdjustTool_00539:TEXT_CTSERKEUREKA3ADJUSTTOOL_00539_A2_000_001:1"
msgid "Enhancing Eureka weapons with mnemes."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 必要な素材について
#. de: Benötigte Materialien
#. fr: Les composants nécessaires
msgctxt "custom/005/CtsErkEureka3AdjustTool_00539:TEXT_CTSERKEUREKA3ADJUSTTOOL_00539_A2_000_002:1"
msgid "Required materials."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 戻る
#. de: Zurück
#. fr: Retour
msgctxt "custom/005/CtsErkEureka3AdjustTool_00539:TEXT_CTSERKEUREKA3ADJUSTTOOL_00539_A2_000_003:1"
msgid "Return."
msgstr ""

#. ja: (-幻想転写器の説明書-)この「<sheet EObj 2009647 0>」は、下地として整えた武器に対し、<br>記憶を転写して能力を高めてやるための装置だ。<br>使い方は簡単だから、この説明書をしっかりと読めよ。
#. de: (-Anleitung des Mnemskriptors-)<i>Der <noun-de EObj 5 2009647 1 1 1> dient dazu, „Mnemen“ genannte Eigenschaften als Sub-Parameter in Waffen zu implantieren und diese dadurch zu verstärken.<br>Hinweis: Der Erfinder dieser grandiosen Apparatur empfiehlt, die Bedienungsanleitung gründlich zu studieren!</i>
#. fr: (-Manuel du kit de transplantation mnésique-)Vous avez devant vous <noun-fr EObj 2 2009647 1 1>, une p'tite merveille de mon invention qui permet de greffer des souvenirs sur les armes que j'ai forgées rien que pour ça. Son utilisation est simple comme bonjour, mais vous allez quand même me faire le plaisir de lire la notice<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/005/CtsErkEureka3AdjustTool_00539:TEXT_CTSERKEUREKA3ADJUSTTOOL_00539_MANUAL00539_000_020:1"
msgid "(-Mnemeworks Manual-)“It is strongly recommended that you familiarize yourself with all aspects of the mnemeworks station before attempting to enhance an armament. Failure to do so may lead to catastrophic failure and/or grievous bodily harm and/or death...”"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「サブパラメータの付与」を行うことで、<br>「エウレカウェポン・ピューロス」などに、<br>サブパラメータを付与することができます。
#. de: Wenn man die Option „Sub-Parameter implantieren“ wählt, kann man sogenannte Sub-Parameter auf Pyros-Waffen übertragen und sie so verstärken.
#. fr: Le menu “Greffer des bonus additionnels” permet d'ajouter des bonus additionnels différents sur vos armes Eurêka Pyros.
msgctxt "custom/005/CtsErkEureka3AdjustTool_00539:TEXT_CTSERKEUREKA3ADJUSTTOOL_00539_SYSTEM_000_021:1"
msgid "Through the use of the mnemeworks, you may imbue your Pyros weapon with additional properties."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 付与されるサブパラメータの種類と数値は、<br>ランダムで決定されますが、触媒さえ用意すれば、<br>何度でも繰り返し実行できます。
#. de: Die implantierten Sub-Parameter und ihre Werte werden zufällig bestimmt, der Prozess kann jedoch durch Verwendung der entsprechenden Katalysatoren beliebig oft wiederholt werden.
#. fr: Le type et la valeur de ces bonus additionnels sont déterminés au hasard, mais il est possible de retenter une greffe autant de fois que désiré du moment que vous êtes prêt<if $gn4>e</if> à fournir les composants nécessaires.
msgctxt "custom/005/CtsErkEureka3AdjustTool_00539:TEXT_CTSERKEUREKA3ADJUSTTOOL_00539_SYSTEM_000_022:1"
msgid "The strength and nature of these properties will be determined at random. Moreover, should you possess sufficient materials, this process may be repeated."
msgstr ""

#. ja: (-幻想転写器の説明書-)武器に記憶を転写して能力を高めるには、<br>「<sheet Item 24122 0>」が必要だ。<br>詳しい理屈は置いといて、触媒として必要になるってこった。
#. de: (-Anleitung des Mnemskriptors-)<i>Um eine Pyros-Waffe mit einem aus Mnemen gewonnenen Sub-Parameter zu modifizieren, werden sogenannte <noun-de Item 5 24122 2 1 1> benötigt. Sie sind die Katalysatoren, die für den Herstellungsprozess erforderlich sind.</i>
#. fr: (-Manuel du kit de transplantation mnésique-)Écrire des pavés, c'pas mon truc, alors j'vais pas rentrer dans les détails. Pour greffer des souvenirs sur mes armes, il faut des <noun-fr Item 12 24122 2 1><nbsp>! Eh ouais, c'est comme ça<nbsp>!
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 24122 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = 24122, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/005/CtsErkEureka3AdjustTool_00539:TEXT_CTSERKEUREKA3ADJUSTTOOL_00539_MANUAL00539_000_030:1"
msgid "(-Mnemeworks Manual-)“Please ensure you have sufficient <noun-en Item 3 24122 2 1> before utilizing the mnemeworks station. Failure to do so may lead to catastrophic failure and/or grievous bodily harm and/or death...”"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「サブパラメータの付与」を行うには、<br>「<sheet Item 24122 0>」が一定数、必要になります。
#. de: Für die Implantation von Sub-Parametern wird eine bestimmte Anzahl an <noun-de Item 5 24122 2 3 1> benötigt.
#. fr: Le processus de greffe de bonus additionnels demande l'utilisation <noun-fr Item 8 24122 2 1>.
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 24122 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = 24122, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/005/CtsErkEureka3AdjustTool_00539:TEXT_CTSERKEUREKA3ADJUSTTOOL_00539_SYSTEM_000_031:1"
msgid "In order to enhance a Pyros weapon, you must possess the requisite quantity of <noun-en Item 3 24122 2 1>."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 必要となる個数は、武器によって異なり、<br>片手剣は「<num $n1>」個、盾は「<num $n2>」個、<br>その他の武器は「<num $n3>」個となります。
#. de: Die benötigte Anzahl der Kristalle variiert dabei je nach Waffe.<br>Paladin-Schwerter: <num $n1><br>Schilde: <num $n2><br>Andere Waffen: <num $n3>
#. fr: Le nombre requis dépend du type d'équipement à améliorer.<br><num $n1> pour les épées de gladiateur.<br><num $n2> pour les boucliers.<br><num $n3> pour les autres types d'armes.
#. macro: <if $n1><if ($n1 <= 10)><switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n1><… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($n1 <= 10)><switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n1></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 <= 10 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if $n3><if ($n3 <= 10)><switch $n3><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n3><… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 3 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($n3 <= 10)><switch $n3><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n3></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 3 <= 10 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $n3><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 3 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <num $n3> — a number; value = number parameter 3 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 24122 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = 24122, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/005/CtsErkEureka3AdjustTool_00539:TEXT_CTSERKEUREKA3ADJUSTTOOL_00539_SYSTEM_000_032:1"
msgid "This quantity will vary depending on the weapon in question. A paladin's arm requires <if $n1><if ($n1 <= 10)><switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n1></if><else><num $n1></if>, as does a shield. All other weapons require <if $n3><if ($n3 <= 10)><switch $n3><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n3></if><else><num $n3></if> <noun-en Item 3 24122 2 1>."
msgstr ""

#. ja: なお、「<sheet Item 24122 0>」は、<br>「<sheet EObj 2009646 0>」を起動し、エウレカケトルに蓄積された、<br>混合エーテルを一定値、消費することで入手できます。
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de Item 5 24122 2 1 1></capitalize> werden im <noun-de EObj 5 2009646 1 3 1> erzeugt. Für ihre Herstellung benötigst du Äthergemisch aus dem Ätherkessel.
#. fr: Ces cristaux peuvent être synthétisés à l'aide <noun-fr EObj 9 2009646 1 1>. Cette opération consomme l'éther composite contenu dans la bouilloire Eurêka.
#. macro: <capitalize><noun-en Item 3 24122 2 1></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 24122 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = 24122, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/005/CtsErkEureka3AdjustTool_00539:TEXT_CTSERKEUREKA3ADJUSTTOOL_00539_SYSTEM_000_033:1"
msgid "<capitalize><noun-en Item 3 24122 2 1></capitalize> are created by converting accumulated vitiated aether with the aid of a Mark II crystal forge."
msgstr ""

#. ja: また、「<sheet Item 24122 0>」を入手できるのは、<br>「<sheet ContentFinderCondition $n1 43>」の「<sheet EObj 2009646 0>」のみで、<br>それ以外の「試製魔晶炉」では入手できないため、ご注意ください。
#. de: Bitte beachte, dass du <noun-de Item 5 24122 2 4 1> nur mit <noun-de EObj 2 2009646 1 3 1> aus <sheet ContentFinderCondition $n1 43> erzeugen kannst. Andere Maginit-Öfen sind dafür nicht geeignet.
#. fr: Notez que la synthèse des <noun-fr Item 12 24122 2 1> ne peut être réalisée qu'avec <noun-fr EObj 2 2009646 1 1> se trouvant à Eurêka Pyros.
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 24122 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = 24122, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
